n_rationale":"The abstract describes a deep learning framework over drug response, genetics, expression, and CRISPR screens. It does not present a substantive text or language component.","evidence_snippet":"\"learns molecular mechanisms of drug sensitivity and resistance\"; \"integrating genetics, gene expression, and CRISPR screens\""},{"record_id":"rec_001128","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"yes","primary_exclusion_code":"none","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is a gene expression language model trained self-supervised on single-cell RNA profiles. The language-model framing and gene-context learning support a text-style modeling component tied to biology.","evidence_snippet":"\"single-cell gene expression language model\"; \"trained across a diversity of cell types\"; \"learn context dependencies between genes\""}]}
