del_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is a radiogenomics model that predicts gene expression from MRI images. The abstract contains no substantive text or language component.","evidence_snippet":"\"predicts the expression contents of genetic factors ... using MRI images\""},{"record_id":"rec_002341","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"GenoCGC is a CNN/Graphormer model for genomic sequence classification. The mention of genomic large language models is only for comparison, not part of the candidate model.","evidence_snippet":"\"hybrid model combining Convolutional Neural Network (CNN) and a Graph-based Transformer\" and \"compared GenoCGC ... with genomic large language models\""},{"record_id":"rec_002342","paper_type":"application_wrapper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"application_wrapper","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"EP2vec uses embeddings learned using an unsupervised NLP method and then trains a classifier for EPI prediction. That is a downstream wrapper around NLP-derived features.","evidence_snippet":"\"sequence embedding features ... learned ... using an unsupervised deep learning method in natural language processing\""},{"record_id":"rec_002343","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract proposes a modified VAE for integrating omics modalities and predicting drug response. It is purely biological/modal data, with 