","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract explicitly describes a review of biomarkers and immunotherapy trials in esophageal cancer. It is not a primary model paper.","evidence_snippet":"\"This review comprehensively examines evolving biomarkers and therapeutic trials\""}]}
