esent":"yes","primary_exclusion_code":"none","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract describes jointly training language models on scRNA-seq-derived text datasets and biomedical literature. That supports both a text component and a substantive bio-text bridge.","evidence_snippet":"\"jointly train language models on both information sources\" and \"common, literature-enriched representation\""},{"record_id":"rec_002229","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The title and abstract state this is a review of machine learning methods for heart disease prediction. It is not a primary model paper.","evidence_snippet":"\"This review examines various computational models\" for heart disease prediction"},{"record_id":"rec_002230","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"unclear","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract explicitly says this is a systematic review of AutoML with interpretation in healthcare. It synthesizes prior work rather than presenting a primary model.","evidence_snippet":"\"We conducted a systematic review\" of AutoML with interpretation systems for healthcare"},{"record_id":"rec_002231","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"unclear","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract says the paper is a review of human genome assembly, pan-genomes, and pre-trained genomic models. This is not a primary candidate model paper.","evidence_snippet":"\"Therefore, this review focuses on ... pre-trained genomic large language models\""},{"record_id":"rec_002232","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract explicitly describes a review of biomarkers and immunotherapy trials in esophageal cancer. It is not a primary model paper.","evidence_snippet":"\"This review comprehensively examines evolving biomarkers and therapeutic trials\""}]}
